        [
          "text",
          "Choose an installed layout"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "From the live session, start "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/installation/MiniOS-Installer.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "MiniOS Installer"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " when you want MiniOS on another USB drive, SSD, or hard disk."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "list",
      {
        "ordered": false,
        "start": 1
      },
      [
        [
          "item",
          null,
          [
            [
              "block",
              "paragraph",
              [
                [
                  "text",
                  "Live mode preserves the compressed module stack and live boot layout. It supports optional session persistence and is suited to portable installations."
                ]
              ]
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "item",
          null,
          [
            [
              "block",
              "paragraph",
              [
                [
                  "text",
                  "Native mode expands the selected modules into a conventional Linux root filesystem, generates initramfs, and installs a supported bootloader. Native mode is available only when the booted image provides the required installer metadata."
                ]
              ]
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Live persistence is prepared during early boot; the detailed behavior is in"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/configuration/Initrd-Persistence.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Initrd persistence"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          ". It does not apply to"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "the conventional root filesystem used by native mode."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "The installer supports automatic BIOS/MBR, UEFI/MBR, and UEFI/GPT layouts. BIOS on GPT is not supported by the current installer. See "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/installation/MiniOS-Installer.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Using MiniOS Installer"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " for placement, filesystem, persistence, and partitioning limits."
        ]
      ]
